   "etapa": "explicar",
   "piezas": [
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Community work",
     "texto": [
      "**Dugnad** is a voluntary activity in which neighbours work together on a shared task. A **borettslag** is a housing cooperative; its residents share some areas and responsibilities."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    },
    {
     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Reflexive possessives",
     "texto": [
      "**Sin**, **sitt** and **sine** refer to something belonging to the subject of the sentence: **Han rydder boden sin** («He tidies his own storage room»). The form depends on the noun: common, **sin**; neuter, **sitt**; plural, **sine**."
     ],
     "tutora": ""
    }
   ]
  },
